Maintainer: RingtailedFox <slycooper1986@yahoo.ca>
Installed-Size: 621
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libicu76 | libicu74
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Description: We all edit. Community build/fork of Microsoft Edit (v2.0.0) — a modern terminal editor.
 A lightweight, fast, MS-DOS EDIT-inspired text editor written in Rust.
 Includes syntax highlighting, search, menus, and a classic UI.
 This package installs the unofficial ARM64 Linux community build.  Not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.
